{"id": "section-body-05017", "title": "Maternal HIV Care and Treatment", "chapterId": "chapter-six", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "MANAGEMENT OF HIV AND AIDS", "Management of Adult and Adolescent Living with HIV with Antiretroviral Therapy", "Maternal HIV Care and Treatment"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-05017", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Maternal HIV Care and Treatment", "runs": [{"text": "Maternal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "HIV"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Care"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Treatment"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1741"}}, {"id": "body-05018", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "PBFW living with HIV should be started on lifelong ART at the time of diagnosis. The recommended first line regimen is once a day fixed dose regimen of Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) +Lamivudine (3TC) + Dolutegravir (DTG). Alternatively, Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) +Lamivudine (3TC) + Efavirenz (EFV400mg) may be an option for use on events of or DTG side effects and adverse events.", "runs": [{"text": "PBFW"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "living"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "HIV"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "started"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lifelong"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ART"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "time"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnosis."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "first"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "line"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "regimen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "once a day fixed dose regimen of Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) +Lamivudine (3TC) + Dolutegravir (DTG). Alternatively, Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) +Lamivudine (3TC) + Efavirenz (EFV400mg) may be an option for use on events of or DTG side effects and adverse events."}]}, {"id": "body-05019", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Before ART initiation, health care provider should discuss health benefits of lifelong ART, including ART impact in preventing mother to child transmission of HIV. A client should understand and comprehend all possible side effects of ARVs. For clients on 2nd and 3rd line ART regimens should continue with their current regimens.", "runs": [{"text": "Before"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ART"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "initiation,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "care"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "provider"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "discuss"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "benefits"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lifelong"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ART,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "including"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ART"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "impact"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "preventing mother"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "child"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "transmission"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "HIV."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "A"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "client"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "understand"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "comprehend"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "all"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "possible"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "side"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "effects"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ARVs."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clients on 2"}, {"text": "nd", "vertical": "superscript"}, {"text": " and 3"}, {"text": "rd", "vertical": "superscript"}, {"text": " line ART regimens should continue with their current regimens."}]}, {"id": "body-05021", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Table 6.7 Maternal HIV Care and Treatment", "runs": [{"text": "Table"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "6.7"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Maternal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "HIV"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Care"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Treatment"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-05022", "type": "table", "rows": [{"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r1-c1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Pregnant\tand\tLactating women", "runs": [{"text": "Pregnant", "bold": true}, {"text": "\t", "bold": true}, {"text": "and", "bold": true}, {"text": "\t", "bold": true}, {"text": "Lactating women", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 0}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r1-c2-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "1st line therapy", "runs": [{"text": "1st", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "line", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "therapy", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 1}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r1-c3-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "2nd line therapy", "runs": [{"text": "2nd", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "line", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "therapy", "bold": true}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 2}], "header": false}, {"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r2-c1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Preferred Option", "runs": [{"text": "Preferred"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Option"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 0}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r2-c2-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "A: TDF + 3TC+ DTG", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "TDF"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3TC+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DTG"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 1}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r2-c3-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "If TDF was used as first line, use ABC plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r", "runs": [{"text": "If TDF was used as first line, use ABC plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 2}], "header": false}, {"cells": [{"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r3-c1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "Alternative Options", "runs": [{"text": "Alternative"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Options"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 0}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r3-c2-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "A: ABC + 3TC + DTG TDF+3TC+EFV (400mg)", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "ABC"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3TC"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "+"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DTG "}, {"text": "TDF+3TC+EFV (400mg)"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 1}, {"blocks": [{"id": "body-05022-r3-c3-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "If TDF was used as first line, use ABC plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r", "runs": [{"text": "If TDF was used as first line, use ABC plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r"}]}, {"id": "body-05022-r3-c3-00003", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "If ABC was used as first line, use TDF plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r", "runs": [{"text": "If ABC was used as first line, use TDF plus 3TC plus ATV/r or LPV/r"}]}, {"id": "body-05022-r3-c3-00004", "type": "paragraph", "style": "TableParagraph", "text": "If TLE was used as first line, use ABC plus 3TC plus DTG", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "TLE"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "was"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "first"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "line,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "use"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ABC"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plus"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "3TC"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "plus"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DTG"}]}], "colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "column": 2}], "header": false}], "columns": 3}, {"id": "body-05023-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Note:", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-05023-textbox1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Tenofovir alafenamide (TAF) is currently not recommended in pregnancy due to unknown safety profile.", "runs": [{"text": "Tenofovir"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "alafenamide"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(", "bold": true}, {"text": "TAF)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "currently"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "recommended"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pregnancy"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unknown"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "safety"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "profile."}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1732"}}, {"id": "body-05023-textbox1-00003", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "It is recommended that all women on DTG should routinely receive high dose Folic acid (5mg) pre-conception and during pregnancy. Clients with DTG intolerance such as severe liver diseases should not be given DTG containing regimens", "runs": [{"text": "It is recommended that all women on DTG should routinely receive high dose Folic acid (5mg) pre-conception and during pregnancy. Clients with DTG intolerance such as severe liver diseases should not be given DTG containing regimens"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1732"}}, {"id": "body-05025", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "*Whenever possible all women on ART should receive routine LFT and RFT as per guideline on monitoring of individuals on ART*", "runs": [{"text": "*Whenever possible all women on ART should receive routine LFT and RFT as per guideline on monitoring of individuals on ", "italic": true}, {"text": "ART*", "italic": true}]}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Management of hiv and aids", "start": "body-05017", "end": "body-05025"}}